PNV 1
EPISTEMIC CHYBA
MODE INTERNAL_EXECUTION
# Selected immutable result from PIP_EBRE_FINITE_CASES_V1_0, not arbitrary asserted truth.
# Exact-scope reuse of Q in the fixed finite theory family.
OP CT SOURCE cached.theory
OP CP SOURCE cached.premises
OP CV SOURCE cached.proved
OP CO SOURCE cached.occurrence
OP CR SOURCE cached.receipt_ref
OP T SOURCE query.theory
OP P SOURCE query.premises
OP O SOURCE query.occurrence
OP TS IDENTITY CT T
OP PS IDENTITY CP P
OP VS IDENTITY CV TRUE
OP W COMPOSITION TS PS VS
OP YES COMPOSITION TRUE TRUE TRUE
OP REUSABLE IDENTITY W YES
OP TRACE COMPOSITION CO CR CT CP CV
OP INFERENCE COMPOSITION O T P REUSABLE TRACE
EMIT REUSABLE
EMIT W
EMIT INFERENCE
